OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Ftoday with just a little high cloud
OL,7,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,8,FFeeling hot, although sea breezes
OL,9,Foffering some relief.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and warm evening to come
OL,12,Fwith some hazy sunshine. Overnight
OL,13,Fcloud will continue to thicken with
OL,14,Fsome rain possibly arriving into the
OL,15,Fnorthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
