OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards throughout Friday but
OL,7,Ftending to weaken as it does so. Many
OL,8,Fareas becoming dry during the
OL,9,Fafternoon with sunny spells but
OL,10,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,13,Fdry throughout the weekend with a mix
OL,14,Fof cloud and sunshine. Dry initially
OL,15,FMonday but rain may move in later.
OL,16,FFeeling cooler as temperatures return
OL,17,Fto nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
